// # SCADA, Industrial Automation & Fieldbus Protocols Facade
//
// Logline: Unified facade re-exporting OPC-UA, Modbus, DNP3, EtherCAT, CANopen, BACnet, and PLC automation.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and facade importing all 49 companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular Industrial Automation, SCADA, Fieldbus, and PLC logic subcomponents.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, frame encoders, state machines, and protocol entry points.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility with downstream openOODA industrial callers.

